WEBVTT

00:00.880 --> 00:02.547
Rather than wait for death

00:02.680 --> 00:04.347
Better to take the initiative

00:04.480 --> 00:05.520
Prepare troops, exit the city

00:05.680 --> 00:07.080
Yes

00:26.400 --> 00:27.600
General

00:27.680 --> 00:28.480
General

00:28.560 --> 00:29.960
General's calculations are flawless

00:30.200 --> 00:31.600
They've left the city

00:32.960 --> 00:34.160
Brothers

00:34.240 --> 00:35.120
Mount up

00:35.240 --> 00:35.920
I'll lead you

00:36.000 --> 00:37.480
To take the city today

00:37.560 --> 00:38.720
Yes

00:50.000 --> 01:08.000
With just a single charge, the ranks of two thousand soldiers were pierced through by iron cavalry. The Yiyang Army retreated in panic as Shi Lang pursued relentlessly, reaping heads like mowing wheat.
